Parameter Type Required Description <code>session_id</code> string no Session to check (auto-detected if omitted) <code>unread_only</code> boolean no Only unread messages (default: true) <code>mark_read</code> boolean no Mark returned messages as read (default: true) <p>Returns:</p> <pre><code>{
  "session_id": "d2cf72cc-...",
  "count": 1,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f6",
      "from": "9a004367-...",
      "to": "d2cf72cc-...",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-13T08:00:00+00:00",
      "message": "pull main and rerun the tests",
      "read": false
    }
  ]
}
</code></pre>

Parameter Type Required Description <code>limit</code> integer no Max sessions to return (default: 20) <p>Returns:</p> <pre><code>{
  "current": "9a004367-...",
  "sessions": [
    {"session_id": "9a004367-...", "modified": "2026-04-13T08:00:00+00:00", "is_current": true},
    {"session_id": "d2cf72cc-...", "modified": "2026-04-13T06:00:00+00:00", "is_current": false}
  ]
}
</code></pre>
